      "intent": "Use an anchored export panel with a format list and short support summary, a Setup section for missing tools, and a job-status section with stages, warning count and output action. Pins: 1 capabilities and setup are separated; 2 status shows the current stage; 3 warnings and outputs have clear actions. No invented percentage completion.",
